  "source_code": "T=int(input())\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(T):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    \r\n    pref=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        pref[i+1]=pref[i]+a[i]\r\n        \r\n    ans=0\r\n    \r\n    for A in range(n+1):\r\n        def value(B):\r\n            return (2*pref[A]+pref[A+2*B]+3*pref[3*n-2*A-B])\r\n        lo=0\r\n        Hi=n-A\r\n        \r\n        while lo<Hi:\r\n            mid=(lo+Hi)//2 \r\n            q=A+2*mid\r\n            m=3*n-2*A-mid\r\n            delta=a[q]+a[q+1]-3*a[m-1]\r\n            \r\n            if delta > 0:\r\n                lo=mid+1\r\n            else:\r\n                Hi=mid\r\n        \r\n        B=lo\r\n        ans=max(ans,value(B))\r\n        \r\n        if B>0:\r\n            ans=max(ans,value(B-1))\r\n    \r\n    print(ans)",
